{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜结构图\n窗口、连续扫掠和命中输出。[[Combat/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Combat.canvas|运行流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GA / Montage Event\n`BeginTraceWindow(StartSocket, EndSocket, Radius)` → 打开窗口。\n`EndTraceWindow()` → 关闭。\n[[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMeleeTraceComponent\n`TickComponent()` / `PerformTrace()` → 上帧至本帧连续扫掠。\n`IsTracing()` → 窗口状态。\n`OnMeleeHit(Actor, Hit)` → 命中广播。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SkeletalMesh Socket / TraceChannel\nStartSocket、EndSocket 定义判定线段；TraceRadius 与碰撞通道决定扫掠体。",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 窗口内状态\nPreviousStart/End：跨帧轨迹基线。\nHitActorsThisWindow：弱引用去重；新窗口清空。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gas",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AbilitySystem / Physics\nGA 接命中后应用 GE/Cue；HitResult 可携材质标签。[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Physics/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 窗口与命中接口契约\nGA/Montage Event → MeleeTrace::BeginTraceWindow(StartSocket, EndSocket, Radius)；EndTraceWindow 关闭判定。\nMeleeTrace::TickComponent → PerformTrace；Mesh::GetSocketLocation 与 SweepMultiByChannel 产 HitResult，HitActorsThisWindow 在窗口内去重。\nOnMeleeHit.Broadcast(Actor, Hit) → BossMeleeAbility::HandleMeleeHit → SourceASC::MakeOutgoingSpec / ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget；Trace 只报告命中，不拥有伤害公式。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "ga",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "trace",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "开/关判定窗口"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "mesh",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "trace",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "骨骼坐标与碰撞设置"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "trace",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "memory",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "保存基线与去重"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "trace",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "gas",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "OnMeleeHit 结果"
    }
  ]
}
